abstract: >-
  python library for simulation and visualisation of linear
  optical, fixed photon number, quantum photonic circuits.


  Checkout example notebooks for usage. It is currently
  under development, but hopefully will become a proper
  package one day. Feel free to email me if you have any
  questions about it.
